WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:12.089
&gt;&gt; Greg: AN AMAZING THING TOOK

00:00:11.722 --> 00:00:13.357
PLACE WEDNESDAY.

00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:14.558
THE SCHOOL RESOURCE OFFICER IN

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.493
ILLINOIS TAPPED A 19-YEAR-OLD

00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:17.361
GUNMAN AND A HIGH SCHOOL SAVING

00:00:16.626 --> 00:00:18.295
COUNTLESS LIVES.

00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:20.163
WHEN THE SUSPECT STARTED

00:00:18.428 --> 00:00:22.032
SHOOTING NEAR THE SCHOOL GYM,

00:00:20.297 --> 00:00:23.300
THE OFFICER CONFRONTED HIM,

00:00:22.165 --> 00:00:25.235
CHASED HIM, SHOT HIM.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.504
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT BE MORE PROUD OF THE

00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:28.572
POLICE OFFICER AND WHEN HE

00:00:27.637 --> 00:00:29.806
RESPONDED TO THE SITUATION.

00:00:28.705 --> 00:00:31.274
SHOTS RINGING OUT IN THE

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.744
HALLWAYS OF THE SCHOOL, HE

00:00:31.408 --> 00:00:35.412
CHARGED TOWARD THE SUSPECT AND

00:00:33.877 --> 00:00:36.413
CONFRONTED HIM HEAD-ON.

00:00:35.545 --> 00:00:38.448
BECAUSE OF HIS HEROIC ACTIONS,

00:00:36.546 --> 00:00:40.050
COUNTLESS LIVES WERE SAVED.

00:00:38.582 --> 00:00:41.618
WE ARE FOREVER INDEBTED TO HIM

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:42.819
FOR HIS SERVICE AND BRAVERY.

00:00:41.752 --> 00:00:44.688
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE OBVIOUS QUESTION

00:00:42.953 --> 00:00:45.021
IS WHY ISN'T THIS ALL OVER THE

00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:46.089
NEWS?

00:00:45.155 --> 00:00:47.858
SOMEONE ONCE SAID NEWS ISN'T

00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:48.759
JUST WHAT HAPPENS.

00:00:47.991 --> 00:00:50.694
IT'S WHAT DOESN'T HAPPEN.

00:00:48.892 --> 00:00:52.863
THE PROBLEM IS IN THIS CASE THE

00:00:50.827 --> 00:00:54.264
MEDIA ISN'T INTERESTED IN WHAT

00:00:52.996 --> 00:00:56.032
DOESN'T HAPPEN.

00:00:54.398 --> 00:00:57.067
LIVES WERE SAVED THANKFULLY SO

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:57.701
THE STORY DIDN'T FIT THE

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.771
NARRATIVE.

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:03.340
THE PRESS MOVED ON TO OTHER

00:01:00.904 --> 00:01:03.707
NONHAPPENING THINGS LIKE

00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:05.041
COLLUSION.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.675
OBVIOUSLY IT'S GOOD NEWS THAT

00:01:05.175 --> 00:01:07.611
THIS WASN'T A BIG STORY.

00:01:05.809 --> 00:01:09.813
BUT IT'S ALSO BAD NEWS THAT IT

00:01:07.744 --> 00:01:12.015
ISN'T A BIG STORY FOR ITS OWN

00:01:09.946 --> 00:01:13.817
SAKE BECAUSE IN THIS NONNEWS

00:01:12.149 --> 00:01:16.553
STORY, TRUTH IS REVEALED.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:16.887
ONE CAN SAVE LIVES BY PROTECTING

00:01:16.686 --> 00:01:18.789
PEOPLE.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:20.056
FOR THE DURATION OF A GUN ATTACK

00:01:18.922 --> 00:01:21.992
IS ALWAYS DICTATED FOR THE

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:24.361
ARRIVAL OF THE SECOND GUN.

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:25.495
THIS INCIDENT IS NO EXCEPTION.

00:01:24.494 --> 00:01:28.498
LOOK UP THE UNPUBLISHED CDC

00:01:25.629 --> 00:01:29.199
REPORT THAT INDICATES NEARLY

00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:31.001
2.5 MILLION DEFENSIVE USES OF

00:01:29.332 --> 00:01:32.969
GUNS A YEAR.

00:01:31.134 --> 00:01:34.805
DIDN'T HEAR ABOUT THAT EITHER?

00:01:33.103 --> 00:01:35.372
I DID SAY IT WAS UNPUBLISHED.

00:01:34.938 --> 00:01:37.674
I WONDER WHY.

00:01:35.505 --> 00:01:39.609
IT'S THE WAY THE PRESS USES

00:01:37.808 --> 00:01:41.278
SILENCE SELECTIVELY TO CREATE

00:01:39.743 --> 00:01:42.913
ONLY ONE STORY ANGLE THAT

00:01:41.411 --> 00:01:43.280
CARRIES THE SEAL OF MEDIA

00:01:43.046 --> 00:01:44.414
APPROVAL.

00:01:43.413 --> 00:01:45.415
WHICH IS WHY I DID THIS

00:01:44.548 --> 00:01:46.583
MONOLOGUE IN THE FIRST PLACE WAS

00:01:45.549 --> 00:01:50.754
SOMEONE MIGHT HEAR IT AND YOU

00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:51.421
KNOW THE NAME OF MARK DALLAS.

00:01:50.887 --> 00:01:51.922
K.G., MARK DALLAS WAS THE

00:01:51.555 --> 00:01:54.391
OFFICER.

00:01:52.055 --> 00:01:57.694
I FIND IT INTERESTING THE MEDIA

00:01:54.524 --> 00:01:58.228
IS INTERESTED IN GUN STORIES

00:01:57.828 --> 00:02:00.497
EXCEPT FOR THESE.

00:01:58.361 --> 00:02:01.331
&gt;&gt; Kimberly: THEY ARE NOT

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.500
INTERESTED IN WHERE GUNS SAVE

00:02:01.465 --> 00:02:06.102
LIVES AND ARE USED TO PUT DOWN

00:02:03.633 --> 00:02:06.770
SOMEBODY THAT IN FACT WAS TRYING

00:02:06.236 --> 00:02:09.372
TO DO HARM.

00:02:06.903 --> 00:02:09.873
I LIKE THE WAY YOU ENDED IT.

00:02:09.506 --> 00:02:12.776
THAT'S IMPORTANT.

00:02:10.006 --> 00:02:14.177
TO KNOW THE NAME OF THE

00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:15.779
INDIVIDUAL THAT COMMITTED A

00:02:14.311 --> 00:02:16.513
HEROIC ACT AND SAVED LIVES AND

00:02:15.912 --> 00:02:18.982
THAT'S THE WHOLE POINT.

00:02:16.646 --> 00:02:20.784
WHEN WE TALK ABOUT SCHOOLS AND

00:02:19.115 --> 00:02:22.219
GUN FREE ZONES AND THINGS LIKE

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:23.420
THAT BETTER VERY, VERY

00:02:22.352 --> 00:02:25.589
VULNERABLE, SOFT TARGETS, THINK

00:02:24.287 --> 00:02:27.390
ABOUT IT OVER AND OVER.

00:02:25.722 --> 00:02:28.625
I HAVE RESPONDED TO SCENES OF

00:02:27.524 --> 00:02:29.626
THEIR CRIME.

00:02:28.758 --> 00:02:30.560
OFFICER-INVOLVED SHOOTING TEAM.

00:02:29.759 --> 00:02:32.229
ANY TIME THERE WAS A DISCHARGE

00:02:30.694 --> 00:02:32.996
OF A WEAPON OR SHOOTING LIKE

00:02:32.362 --> 00:02:33.396
THAT, THE POLICE HAVE TO GO OUT

00:02:33.129 --> 00:02:35.198
ON IT.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:35.932
YOU SEE WHAT HAPPENS.

00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:39.603
YOU GO TO THE SCHOOL AND YOU GO

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:40.337
TO THESE PLACES AND SAY IF ONLY

00:02:39.736 --> 00:02:43.073
SOMEONE HAD BEEN ARMED THEY ARE

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:45.308
TO BE ABLE TO DO SOMETHING AND

00:02:43.206 --> 00:02:47.978
ACT DECISIVELY, LIVES COULD BE

00:02:45.442 --> 00:02:49.379
SAVED.

00:02:48.111 --> 00:02:51.515
WEAPONS ARE USED IN MANY

00:02:49.513 --> 00:02:52.582
INSTANCES AND WARS TO CREATE

00:02:51.648 --> 00:02:53.884
PEACE ULTIMATELY.

00:02:52.716 --> 00:02:55.085
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE LEFT USES EVERY

00:02:54.017 --> 00:02:56.953
STORY IS SOME KIND OF POLITICAL

00:02:55.218 --> 00:02:58.655
TOOL.

00:02:57.087 --> 00:03:00.056
THIS WAS SOMETHING THAT IS AN

00:02:58.788 --> 00:03:01.691
ARGUMENT FOR MORE GUNS IN

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:01.992
SCHOOLS WE DON'T REALLY HEAR

00:03:01.825 --> 00:03:03.493
THAT.

00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:03.994
&gt;&gt; Dana: PART OF THE REASON IS

00:03:03.627 --> 00:03:06.029
BECAUSE IT WORKS.

00:03:04.127 --> 00:03:07.030
THE PROCESS THAT WAS IN PLACE

00:03:06.162 --> 00:03:08.999
FOR THAT SCHOOL DISTRICT WORKED.

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:10.000
IF THE POLICY WORKS, YOU OFTEN

00:03:09.132 --> 00:03:11.501
DON'T WRITE ABOUT IT.

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:15.205
BUT I ALSO THINK IN SOME WAYS

00:03:11.635 --> 00:03:16.106
YOU CAN DO WHAT YOU ARE SAYING.

00:03:15.338 --> 00:03:17.674
REMEMBER WHEN RAHM EMANUEL SAID

00:03:16.239 --> 00:03:17.974
NEVER LET AN OPPORTUNITY GO TO

00:03:17.807 --> 00:03:18.808
WASTE.

00:03:18.108 --> 00:03:20.143
IT'S TRUE ON THE OTHER SIDE.

00:03:18.942 --> 00:03:21.211
IF YOU ARE A LOCAL SCHOOL

00:03:20.277 --> 00:03:23.780
DISTRICT AND WORRIED ABOUT THE

00:03:21.344 --> 00:03:25.215
POSSIBILITY OF A SHOOTER IN YOUR

00:03:23.914 --> 00:03:27.317
SCHOOL, HAVING AN ARMED RESOURCE

00:03:25.348 --> 00:03:28.618
OFFICER COULD ACTUALLY BE YOUR

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.986
ANSWER.

00:03:28.752 --> 00:03:31.421
&gt;&gt; Greg: JESSE, SHOULD THE

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.788
OFFICER NOT HAVE BEEN THERE WITH

00:03:31.555 --> 00:03:34.424
A GUN?

00:03:31.922 --> 00:03:34.724
SHOULD IT HAVE BEEN A GUN FREE

00:03:34.558 --> 00:03:36.293
ZONE?

00:03:34.858 --> 00:03:37.694
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THIS OFFICER TO THE

00:03:36.426 --> 00:03:38.862
EXACT OPPOSITE OF WHAT THE

00:03:37.827 --> 00:03:40.797
OFFICER DID IN PARKLAND.

00:03:38.995 --> 00:03:42.132
HE WAITED OUTSIDE.

00:03:40.931 --> 00:03:43.033
THIS ONE FOLLOWED PROTOCOL AND

00:03:42.265 --> 00:03:44.434
DIRECTLY ADDRESS TO NEUTRALIZE

00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:46.236
THE SHOOTER.

00:03:44.568 --> 00:03:46.903
YOUR POINT IS EXACTLY RIGHT.

00:03:46.369 --> 00:03:47.637
NEWS ISN'T NECESSARILY ABOUT

00:03:47.037 --> 00:03:50.040
WHAT YOU COVER.

00:03:47.771 --> 00:03:51.374
IT'S ABOUT WHAT YOU DON'T COVER

00:03:50.173 --> 00:03:52.642
AND YOUR ASTEROID ANALOGY RINGS

00:03:51.508 --> 00:03:54.144
TRUE HERE.

00:03:52.776 --> 00:03:55.612
THEY DON'T ALWAYS COVER GOOD

00:03:54.277 --> 00:03:56.079
ECONOMIC NEWS FOR THE TRUMP

00:03:55.745 --> 00:03:58.648
ADMINISTRATION.

00:03:56.212 --> 00:04:00.216
THEY DON'T COVER NEWS THAT MIGHT

00:03:58.782 --> 00:04:01.051
BENEFIT THE NRA NARRATIVE, AND

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.652
THAT'S FINE.

00:04:01.184 --> 00:04:03.620
EVERY OUTLET HAS TO MAKE THEIR

00:04:02.786 --> 00:04:05.655
OWN EDITORIAL DECISION ABOUT

00:04:03.753 --> 00:04:08.692
WHAT THEY DO OR DON'T COVER BUT

00:04:05.789 --> 00:04:10.827
WHEN 90% OF THE MEDIA IS LIBERAL

00:04:08.825 --> 00:04:12.596
AND 10% ISN'T, THERE IS A LOT OF

00:04:10.961 --> 00:04:13.830
IMPACT ABOUT WHAT THAT

00:04:12.729 --> 00:04:15.298
90 PERCENT DOES NOT COVER.

00:04:13.964 --> 00:04:17.334
IT DOES A DISSERVICE TO THE

00:04:15.432 --> 00:04:18.535
READERS AND VIEWERS WHO AREN'T

00:04:17.467 --> 00:04:20.403
FULLY INFORMED BEFORE THEY CAN

00:04:18.668 --> 00:04:20.737
MAKE A DECISION OR HAVE AN

00:04:20.537 --> 00:04:23.206
OPINION.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:24.240
&gt;&gt; Greg: JUAN, I AM SURE MY

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.641
MONOLOGUE CHANGED YOUR MIND

00:04:24.374 --> 00:04:26.276
COMPLETELY.

00:04:24.774 --> 00:04:29.379
&gt;&gt; Juan: IT FELT TO ME LIKE

00:04:26.409 --> 00:04:32.115
SOMEONE HAD A GUN POINTED AT ME.

00:04:29.512 --> 00:04:32.449
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU HAVE FELT THAT

00:04:32.248 --> 00:04:33.850
BEFORE.

00:04:32.582 --> 00:04:35.051
&gt;&gt; Juan: WHAT'S INTERESTING TO

00:04:33.984 --> 00:04:35.819
ME IS NOT THAT IT DOESN'T GET

00:04:35.185 --> 00:04:36.820
COVERED.

00:04:35.952 --> 00:04:38.455
YOU ARE RIGHT.

00:04:36.953 --> 00:04:40.056
IT'S LIKE THE FAMOUS SAYING, WE

00:04:38.588 --> 00:04:40.824
DON'T COVER SAFE LANDINGS AND

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.992
NATIONAL AIRPORTS.

00:04:40.957 --> 00:04:42.392
IT'S NOT TYPICALLY WHAT GETS

00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:45.028
COVERED.

00:04:42.525 --> 00:04:46.029
BUT YOU MAKE IT INTO A POLICY

00:04:45.161 --> 00:04:48.198
ARGUMENT ABOUT WHETHER OR NOT

00:04:46.162 --> 00:04:48.999
GUNS SHOULD BE IN SCHOOLS AND

00:04:48.331 --> 00:04:51.434
CLASSROOMS ALL OVER.

00:04:49.132 --> 00:04:53.803
THAT'S WHERE I THINK I DISENGAGE

00:04:51.568 --> 00:04:56.806
BECAUSE TO MY MIND, I LOOK AT

00:04:53.937 --> 00:04:58.208
STONEMAN, THERE WAS AN ARMED

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.409
GUARD.

00:04:58.341 --> 00:04:59.943
COLUMBINE, VIRGINIA TECH, PULSE

00:04:59.542 --> 00:05:03.713
NIGHTCLUB.

00:05:00.076 --> 00:05:04.581
THERE WERE ARMED GUARDS AT THESE

00:05:03.847 --> 00:05:06.483
MASS SHOOTINGS.

00:05:04.714 --> 00:05:06.750
DID IT STOP THEM?

00:05:06.616 --> 00:05:09.319
NO.

00:05:06.883 --> 00:05:10.420
LET'S GET AWAY FROM A BUNCH OF

00:05:09.452 --> 00:05:12.022
TV PEOPLE.

00:05:10.553 --> 00:05:12.355
LET'S ASK THE TEACHERS IN THESE

00:05:12.155 --> 00:05:13.590
SCHOOLS.

00:05:12.489 --> 00:05:15.225
DO THEY THINK THEY SHOULD HAVE

00:05:13.723 --> 00:05:15.558
GUNS, THERE SHOULD BE ARMED

00:05:15.358 --> 00:05:15.992
GUARDS?

00:05:15.692 --> 00:05:17.794
NO.

00:05:16.126 --> 00:05:19.095
WHAT ABOUT THE PARENTS?

00:05:17.927 --> 00:05:20.597
PARENTS LOVE KIDS, I THINK WE

00:05:19.329 --> 00:05:21.264
CAN ALL AGREE WITH THAT.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.465
PARENTS SAY THEY DON'T WANT

00:05:21.398 --> 00:05:23.833
THESE GUNS IN THEIR SCHOOLS.

00:05:22.599 --> 00:05:26.169
MAYBE BECAUSE THEY KNOW WHEN

00:05:23.967 --> 00:05:28.371
GUNS ARE AROUND, MORE ACCIDENTS,

00:05:26.302 --> 00:05:30.573
MORE FATALITIES.

00:05:28.505 --> 00:05:32.375
&gt;&gt; Greg: I'VE GOT TO MOVE ON.

00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:33.977
MORE GUNS, LESS CRIME.

